Subject: [PATCH] Reconcile obsolete API30 assertions with canonical One UI 9 platform access

The old public-policy snapshot predates keystore2, apexd metadata and
new platform domains. Reconcile its assertions only with existing donor
platform/system_ext grants. Do not exempt vendor grants, add allows or
alter any current One UI 9 assertion. Strict secilc still checks all files.

